## Scope Boundary

This decision does not define:

- spatial train-validation-test assignment
- training-time batch sampling
- loss weighting
- data augmentation
- model architecture
- active learning
- Loop 2 sampling policy

Those decisions require later dataset-splitting, training, evaluation, and error-analysis evidence.